Dialogue: 0,0:01:02.24,0:01:03.91,画面内容,,0,0,0,,{\pos(280,382)}蟹堡王
Dialogue: 1,0:01:03.20,0:01:05.04,标准-Chi,,0,0,0,,蟹黄堡  蟹黄堡
Dialogue: 0,0:01:03.20,0:01:05.04,标准-Eng,,0,0,0,,Krabby Patties Krabby Patties
Dialogue: 1,0:01:05.04,0:01:06.90,标准-Chi,,0,0,0,,我就爱来做一点蟹黄堡
Dialogue: 0,0:01:05.04,0:01:06.90,标准-Eng,,0,0,0,,I love cookin' me some Krabby Patties
Dialogue: 1,0:01:06.90,0:01:08.58,标准-Chi,,0,0,0,,把小朋友和爸妈都喂饱
Dialogue: 0,0:01:06.90,0:01:08.58,标准-Eng,,0,0,0,,Feedin' all the children and the mommas and the daddies
Dialogue: 1,0:01:08.80,0:01:10.49,标准-Chi,,0,0,0,,热爱献上美味佳肴
Dialogue: 0,0:01:08.80,0:01:10.49,标准-Eng,,0,0,0,,Love servin' up the most delicious dish
Dialogue: 1,0:01:10.49,0:01:13.31,标准-Chi,,0,0,0,,但先加一点这个不能少
Dialogue: 0,0:01:10.49,0:01:13.31,标准-Eng,,0,0,0,,But before I can gotta add a little this
Dialogue: 0,0:01:11.38,0:01:13.67,画面内容,,0,0,0,,{\pos(1018,662)}塔塔酱
Dialogue: 1,0:01:14.48,0:01:15.97,标准-Chi,,0,0,0,,该来补塔塔酱了
Dialogue: 0,0:01:14.48,0:01:15.97,标准-Eng,,0,0,0,,Time to refill the tartar sauce
Dialogue: 0,0:01:15.97,0:01:17.38,画面内容,,0,0,0,,{\pos(946,578)}塔塔酱
Dialogue: 1,0:01:18.59,0:01:19.80,标准-Chi,,0,0,0,,空了
Dialogue: 0,0:01:18.59,0:01:19.80,标准-Eng,,0,0,0,,Empty
Dialogue: 1,0:01:19.80,0:01:21.20,标准-Chi,,0,0,0,,没料到会有这么一天
Dialogue: 0,0:01:19.80,0:01:21.20,标准-Eng,,0,0,0,,I thought I'd never see the day
Dialogue: 0,0:01:21.18,0:01:26.89,画面内容,,0,0,0,,{\pos(918,178)}有效期限
Dialogue: 1,0:01:22.87,0:01:26.89,标准-Chi,,0,0,0,,请于以下日期当天或之前使用
Dialogue: 0,0:01:22.87,0:01:26.89,标准-Eng,,0,0,0,,"Use on or before the date printed below"
Dialogue: 1,0:01:27.83,0:01:30.27,标准-Chi,,0,0,0,,这个铁桶已经在这五十年了
Dialogue: 0,0:01:27.83,0:01:30.27,标准-Eng,,0,0,0,,This can has been here for 50 years
Dialogue: 1,0:01:30.80,0:01:32.85,标准-Chi,,0,0,0,,比我在这的年头还久
Dialogue: 0,0:01:30.80,0:01:32.85,标准-Eng,,0,0,0,,That's longer than me
Dialogue: 1,0:01:35.71,0:01:37.27,标准-Chi,,0,0,0,,蟹堡王重要的遗迹啊
Dialogue: 0,0:01:35.71,0:01:37.27,标准-Eng,,0,0,0,,Important Krusty Krab relic
Dialogue: 1,0:01:37.27,0:01:38.32,标准-Chi,,0,0,0,,该拿你怎么办呢
Dialogue: 0,0:01:37.27,0:01:38.32,标准-Eng,,0,0,0,,what shall we do with ye?
Dialogue: 1,0:01:38.56,0:01:39.62,标准-Chi,,0,0,0,,海绵宝宝
Dialogue: 0,0:01:38.56,0:01:39.62,标准-Eng,,0,0,0,,SpongeBob
Dialogue: 1,0:01:39.62,0:01:41.74,标准-Chi,,0,0,0,,把那垃圾丢出去  再回来继续干活
Dialogue: 0,0:01:39.62,0:01:41.74,标准-Eng,,0,0,0,,Throw that trash out and get back to work
Dialogue: 1,0:01:41.94,0:01:42.57,标准-Chi,,0,0,0,,垃圾吗
Dialogue: 0,0:01:41.94,0:01:42.57,标准-Eng,,0,0,0,,Trash?
Dialogue: 1,0:01:42.57,0:01:45.07,标准-Chi,,0,0,0,,可是蟹老板  它应该放到博物馆里
Dialogue: 0,0:01:42.57,0:01:45.07,标准-Eng,,0,0,0,,But, Mr. Krabs, this should be in a museum
Dialogue: 1,0:01:45.07,0:01:46.87,标准-Chi,,0,0,0,,给子孙后代欣赏
Dialogue: 0,0:01:45.07,0:01:46.87,标准-Eng,,0,0,0,,for future generations to enjoy
Dialogue: 1,0:01:48.17,0:01:50.38,标准-Chi,,0,0,0,,子孙后代吗
Dialogue: 0,0:01:48.17,0:01:50.38,标准-Eng,,0,0,0,,Future generations, huh?
Dialogue: 1,0:01:51.16,0:01:55.13,标准-Chi,,0,0,0,,欢迎来到蟹堡王时光胶囊盛会
Dialogue: 0,0:01:51.16,0:01:55.13,标准-Eng,,0,0,0,,Welcome to the Krusty Krab time capsule spectacular
Dialogue: 1,0:01:55.40,0:01:57.62,标准-Chi,,0,0,0,,没错  等五十年后
Dialogue: 0,0:01:55.40,0:01:57.62,标准-Eng,,0,0,0,,That's right, in 50 years
Dialogue: 1,0:01:57.62,0:01:59.85,标准-Chi,,0,0,0,,你们捐赠的财宝就可以出土
Dialogue: 0,0:01:57.62,0:01:59.85,标准-Eng,,0,0,0,,your donated treasures will be unearthed
Dialogue: 1,0:01:59.85,0:02:02.90,标准-Chi,,0,0,0,,献给子孙后代欣赏了
Dialogue: 0,0:01:59.85,0:02:02.90,标准-Eng,,0,0,0,,for future generations to enjoy
Dialogue: 1,0:02:02.90,0:02:04.98,标准-Chi,,0,0,0,,你们两个负责收捐赠物  行吗
Dialogue: 0,0:02:02.90,0:02:04.98,标准-Eng,,0,0,0,,All right, you two got donations covered, right?
Dialogue: 1,0:02:04.98,0:02:06.09,标准-Chi,,0,0,0,,没问题  老板
Dialogue: 0,0:02:04.98,0:02:06.09,标准-Eng,,0,0,0,,Sir, yes, sir
Dialogue: 1,0:02:06.33,0:02:07.06,标准-Chi,,0,0,0,,随便
Dialogue: 0,0:02:06.33,0:02:07.06,标准-Eng,,0,0,0,,Whatever
Dialogue: 1,0:02:07.25,0:02:10.08,标准-Chi,,0,0,0,,我负责卖纪念品去了
Dialogue: 0,0:02:07.25,0:02:10.08,标准-Eng,,0,0,0,,I'm gonna go ahead and take care of souvenirs
Dialogue: 0,0:02:08.85,0:02:09.94,画面内容,,0,0,0,,{\pos(1130,208)}时光胶囊纪念品
Dialogue: 0,0:02:08.85,0:02:09.94,画面内容,,0,0,0,,{\pos(204,830)}时光胶囊\N最强
Dialogue: 1,0:02:14.34,0:02:16.42,标准-Chi,,0,0,0,,未来的人们一定要看看这个
Dialogue: 0,0:02:14.34,0:02:16.42,标准-Eng,,0,0,0,,The peoples of the future must see this
Dialogue: 1,0:02:16.42,0:02:19.95,标准-Chi,,0,0,0,,这样就能知道古时候怎么烤面包了
Dialogue: 0,0:02:16.42,0:02:17.15,标准-Eng,,0,0,0,,so they will know
Dialogue: 0,0:02:17.15,0:02:19.95,标准-Eng,,0,0,0,,how we toasted bread in the before time
Dialogue: 1,0:02:20.12,0:02:21.51,标准-Chi,,0,0,0,,这样就能了解到
Dialogue: 0,0:02:20.12,0:02:21.51,标准-Eng,,0,0,0,,so that they can understand the--
Dialogue: 1,0:02:21.51,0:02:22.39,标准-Chi,,0,0,0,,垃圾
Dialogue: 0,0:02:21.51,0:02:22.39,标准-Eng,,0,0,0,,Garbage
Dialogue: 1,0:02:22.39,0:02:24.54,标准-Chi,,0,0,0,,捐赠费五块钱
Dialogue: 0,0:02:22.39,0:02:24.54,标准-Eng,,0,0,0,,That'll be a $5 contribution fee
Dialogue: 1,0:02:26.70,0:02:29.96,标准-Chi,,0,0,0,,时光胶囊纪念钥匙链拿去
Dialogue: 0,0:02:26.70,0:02:29.96,标准-Eng,,0,0,0,,And there's your commemorative time capsule keychain
Dialogue: 0,0:02:29.96,0:02:33.46,画面内容,,0,0,0,,{\pos(298,638)}第一个\N裤头村时光胶囊\N钥匙链
Dialogue: 1,0:02:29.96,0:02:31.36,标准-Chi,,0,0,0,,总共
Dialogue: 0,0:02:29.96,0:02:31.36,标准-Eng,,0,0,0,,That'll be
Dialogue: 1,0:02:31.36,0:02:33.63,标准-Chi,,0,0,0,,四十九块五毛七
Dialogue: 0,0:02:31.36,0:02:33.63,标准-Eng,,0,0,0,,$49.57, please
Dialogue: 1,0:02:33.63,0:02:37.26,标准-Chi,,0,0,0,,可这是拿生锈的旧回形针和纸板做的
Dialogue: 0,0:02:33.63,0:02:35.09,标准-Eng,,0,0,0,,But this thing's made of
Dialogue: 0,0:02:35.09,0:02:37.26,标准-Eng,,0,0,0,,rusty old paperclips and cardboard
Dialogue: 1,0:02:37.26,0:02:39.93,标准-Chi,,0,0,0,,你也太会讨价还价了
Dialogue: 0,0:02:37.26,0:02:39.93,标准-Eng,,0,0,0,,All right, you drive a hard bargain
Dialogue: 1,0:02:39.93,0:02:42.70,标准-Chi,,0,0,0,,我再送张优惠券
Dialogue: 0,0:02:39.93,0:02:42.70,标准-Eng,,0,0,0,,I'll throw in a coupon
Dialogue: 1,0:02:42.70,0:02:46.02,标准-Chi,,0,0,0,,在蟹堡王买大可乐免费附赠一块冰块
Dialogue: 0,0:02:42.70,0:02:44.01,标准-Eng,,0,0,0,,for one free ice cube
Dialogue: 0,0:02:44.01,0:02:46.02,标准-Eng,,0,0,0,,with a purchase of any large cola at the Krusty Krab
Dialogue: 1,0:02:46.02,0:02:46.75,标准-Chi,,0,0,0,,怎么样
Dialogue: 0,0:02:46.02,0:02:46.75,标准-Eng,,0,0,0,,What do you say?
Dialogue: 1,0:02:47.03,0:02:47.56,标准-Chi,,0,0,0,,成交
Dialogue: 0,0:02:47.03,0:02:47.56,标准-Eng,,0,0,0,,Deal
Dialogue: 0,0:02:52.86,0:02:54.36,画面内容,,0,0,0,,{\pos(614,246)}蟹堡王时光胶囊
Dialogue: 1,0:02:55.84,0:02:57.68,标准-Chi,,0,0,0,,好漂亮的台灯  女士
Dialogue: 0,0:02:55.84,0:02:57.68,标准-Eng,,0,0,0,,What a beautiful lamp, ma'am
Dialogue: 1,0:02:57.68,0:03:01.53,标准-Chi,,0,0,0,,多么华美  用来夜读多么必不可少
Dialogue: 0,0:02:57.68,0:03:01.53,标准-Eng,,0,0,0,,so ornate, so essential for nighttime reading
Dialogue: 1,0:03:01.54,0:03:03.16,标准-Chi,,0,0,0,,多谢了  小伙子
Dialogue: 0,0:03:01.54,0:03:03.16,标准-Eng,,0,0,0,,Why, thank you, young man
Dialogue: 1,0:03:03.16,0:03:04.60,标准-Chi,,0,0,0,,不对  应该谢谢你
Dialogue: 0,0:03:03.16,0:03:04.60,标准-Eng,,0,0,0,,No, thank you
Dialogue: 1,0:03:04.60,0:03:08.83,标准-Chi,,0,0,0,,用你所谓的捐赠让子孙后代大失所望
Dialogue: 0,0:03:04.60,0:03:07.08,标准-Eng,,0,0,0,,For completely failing our future generations
Dialogue: 0,0:03:07.08,0:03:08.83,标准-Eng,,0,0,0,,with your "donation"
Dialogue: 1,0:03:08.83,0:03:10.63,标准-Chi,,0,0,0,,我说真的  女士
Dialogue: 0,0:03:08.83,0:03:10.63,标准-Eng,,0,0,0,,I mean, seriously, ma'am
Dialogue: 1,0:03:10.63,0:03:13.04,标准-Chi,,0,0,0,,不会今早随便看到个东西就来捐了吧
Dialogue: 0,0:03:10.63,0:03:13.04,标准-Eng,,0,0,0,,did you just grab the first thing you saw this morning?
Dialogue: 1,0:03:13.04,0:03:14.19,标准-Chi,,0,0,0,,其实
Dialogue: 0,0:03:13.04,0:03:14.19,标准-Eng,,0,0,0,,Well, actually--
Dialogue: 1,0:03:15.40,0:03:18.67,标准-Chi,,0,0,0,,我应该要给时光胶囊捐赠什么呢
Dialogue: 0,0:03:15.40,0:03:18.67,标准-Eng,,0,0,0,,"Whatever will I donate to the time capsule?
Dialogue: 1,0:03:18.67,0:03:21.24,标准-Chi,,0,0,0,,天啊  好难决定啊
Dialogue: 0,0:03:18.67,0:03:21.24,标准-Eng,,0,0,0,,"Golly, this is hard
Dialogue: 1,0:03:21.62,0:03:22.69,标准-Chi,,0,0,0,,不然就
Dialogue: 0,0:03:21.62,0:03:22.69,标准-Eng,,0,0,0,,"How about
Dialogue: 1,0:03:23.42,0:03:25.01,标准-Chi,,0,0,0,,这盏台灯吧
Dialogue: 0,0:03:23.42,0:03:25.01,标准-Eng,,0,0,0,,This lamp?
Dialogue: 1,0:03:25.29,0:03:28.39,标准-Chi,,0,0,0,,太完美了
Dialogue: 0,0:03:25.29,0:03:28.39,标准-Eng,,0,0,0,,It's perfect"
Dialogue: 1,0:03:29.63,0:03:30.57,标准-Chi,,0,0,0,,好厉害
Dialogue: 0,0:03:29.63,0:03:30.57,标准-Eng,,0,0,0,,You're good
Dialogue: 1,0:03:30.57,0:03:31.70,标准-Chi,,0,0,0,,你怎么知道的
Dialogue: 0,0:03:30.57,0:03:31.70,标准-Eng,,0,0,0,,How did you know all that?
Dialogue: 1,0:03:31.70,0:03:33.02,标准-Chi,,0,0,0,,你是会读心术吗
Dialogue: 0,0:03:31.70,0:03:33.02,标准-Eng,,0,0,0,,Are you, like, a psychic?
Dialogue: 1,0:03:33.85,0:03:34.97,标准-Chi,,0,0,0,,快说我现在在想啥
Dialogue: 0,0:03:33.85,0:03:34.97,标准-Eng,,0,0,0,,Tell me what I'm thinking
Dialogue: 1,0:03:35.19,0:03:35.65,标准-Chi,,0,0,0,,下一个
Dialogue: 0,0:03:35.19,0:03:35.65,标准-Eng,,0,0,0,,Next
Dialogue: 1,0:03:38.01,0:03:39.57,标准-Chi,,0,0,0,,传得好  章鱼哥
Dialogue: 0,0:03:38.01,0:03:39.57,标准-Eng,,0,0,0,,Nice pass, Squidward
Dialogue: 1,0:03:41.84,0:03:44.37,标准-Chi,,0,0,0,,说说看  你对这盘子有多少了解
Dialogue: 0,0:03:41.84,0:03:44.37,标准-Eng,,0,0,0,,Tell me, what do you know about this plate?
Dialogue: 1,0:03:44.82,0:03:46.42,标准-Chi,,0,0,0,,我吃饭的时候用得很顺
Dialogue: 0,0:03:44.82,0:03:46.42,标准-Eng,,0,0,0,,It works good when I eat stuff
Dialogue: 1,0:03:47.04,0:03:47.80,标准-Chi,,0,0,0,,对对对
Dialogue: 0,0:03:47.04,0:03:47.80,标准-Eng,,0,0,0,,Right
Dialogue: 1,0:03:47.80,0:03:50.45,标准-Chi,,0,0,0,,这盘子其实不是用来吃饭的
Dialogue: 0,0:03:47.80,0:03:50.45,标准-Eng,,0,0,0,,This plate is actually not meant to be eaten on
Dialogue: 1,0:03:50.77,0:03:52.29,标准-Chi,,0,0,0,,现在  只要你允许
Dialogue: 0,0:03:50.77,0:03:52.29,标准-Eng,,0,0,0,,Now, with your permission
Dialogue: 1,0:03:52.29,0:03:56.06,标准-Chi,,0,0,0,,我想做几项测试鉴定真伪
Dialogue: 0,0:03:52.29,0:03:54.21,标准-Eng,,0,0,0,,I'd like to perform a few tests
Dialogue: 0,0:03:54.21,0:03:56.06,标准-Eng,,0,0,0,,to verify its authenticity
Dialogue: 1,0:03:56.52,0:03:57.19,标准-Chi,,0,0,0,,好吧
Dialogue: 0,0:03:56.52,0:03:57.19,标准-Eng,,0,0,0,,Okay
Dialogue: 1,0:04:04.05,0:04:05.55,标准-Chi,,0,0,0,,有意思
Dialogue: 0,0:04:04.05,0:04:05.55,标准-Eng,,0,0,0,,Interesting
Dialogue: 1,0:04:09.24,0:04:13.06,标准-Chi,,0,0,0,,这可是个好兆头啊
Dialogue: 0,0:04:09.24,0:04:13.06,标准-Eng,,0,0,0,,This is a promising sign
Dialogue: 1,0:04:13.78,0:04:16.50,标准-Chi,,0,0,0,,对  听见盘子砸脑袋的声音没
Dialogue: 0,0:04:13.78,0:04:16.50,标准-Eng,,0,0,0,,Yup, you hear that plate-hitting-skull sound?
Dialogue: 1,0:04:16.50,0:04:18.68,标准-Chi,,0,0,0,,它绝对是真品
Dialogue: 0,0:04:16.50,0:04:18.68,标准-Eng,,0,0,0,,It's definitely authentic
Dialogue: 1,0:04:18.68,0:04:24.95,标准-Chi,,0,0,0,,在当今市场  我会保守定价为250块
Dialogue: 0,0:04:18.68,0:04:21.19,标准-Eng,,0,0,0,,and I would price it conservatively
Dialogue: 0,0:04:21.19,0:04:24.95,标准-Eng,,0,0,0,,in today's market at $250
Dialogue: 1,0:04:24.95,0:04:25.68,标准-Chi,,0,0,0,,真的吗
Dialogue: 0,0:04:24.95,0:04:25.68,标准-Eng,,0,0,0,,Really?
Dialogue: 1,0:04:25.94,0:04:26.41,标准-Chi,,0,0,0,,假的
Dialogue: 0,0:04:25.94,0:04:26.41,标准-Eng,,0,0,0,,No
Dialogue: 1,0:04:33.67,0:04:36.73,标准-Chi,,0,0,0,,你是时光胶囊最耀眼的明珠
Dialogue: 0,0:04:33.67,0:04:36.73,标准-Eng,,0,0,0,,You are the crown jewel of the time capsule
Dialogue: 1,0:04:36.96,0:04:37.68,标准-Chi,,0,0,0,,下一个
Dialogue: 0,0:04:36.96,0:04:37.68,标准-Eng,,0,0,0,,Next
Dialogue: 1,0:04:38.09,0:04:39.28,标准-Chi,,0,0,0,,带四条条纹的袜子
Dialogue: 0,0:04:38.09,0:04:39.28,标准-Eng,,0,0,0,,A four-striped sock
Dialogue: 1,0:04:39.28,0:04:40.05,标准-Chi,,0,0,0,,好厉害啊
Dialogue: 0,0:04:39.28,0:04:40.05,标准-Eng,,0,0,0,,Incredible
Dialogue: 0,0:04:40.05,0:04:41.76,标准-Chi,,0,0,75,,两小时后
Dialogue: 1,0:04:41.97,0:04:43.67,标准-Chi,,0,0,0,,章鱼哥  大家应该都捐完了
Dialogue: 0,0:04:41.97,0:04:43.67,标准-Eng,,0,0,0,,Okay, Squidward, I think that's everybody
Dialogue: 1,0:04:44.21,0:04:45.30,标准-Chi,,0,0,0,,海绵宝宝  海绵宝宝
Dialogue: 0,0:04:44.21,0:04:45.30,标准-Eng,,0,0,0,,SpongeBob, SpongeBob
Dialogue: 1,0:04:45.30,0:04:46.05,标准-Chi,,0,0,0,,我赶上了吗
Dialogue: 0,0:04:45.30,0:04:46.05,标准-Eng,,0,0,0,,did I make it?
Dialogue: 1,0:04:46.05,0:04:49.80,标准-Chi,,0,0,0,,我带了最爱的石头给时光玩意捐过去
Dialogue: 0,0:04:46.05,0:04:47.47,标准-Eng,,0,0,0,,I brought my favorite rock
Dialogue: 0,0:04:47.47,0:04:49.80,标准-Eng,,0,0,0,,to donate to the time thinger
Dialogue: 1,0:04:51.15,0:04:53.52,标准-Chi,,0,0,0,,你真的舍得把它捐出去吗  派大星
Dialogue: 0,0:04:51.15,0:04:53.52,标准-Eng,,0,0,0,,Are you sure you can part with it, Patrick?
Dialogue: 1,0:04:53.52,0:04:56.03,标准-Chi,,0,0,0,,有时候不得不做出牺牲
Dialogue: 0,0:04:53.52,0:04:56.03,标准-Eng,,0,0,0,,Sometimes you got to make sacrifices
Dialogue: 1,0:04:56.03,0:04:57.37,标准-Chi,,0,0,0,,你先请吧
Dialogue: 0,0:04:56.03,0:04:57.37,标准-Eng,,0,0,0,,After you, then
Dialogue: 1,0:04:57.37,0:04:58.51,标准-Chi,,0,0,0,,谢谢你  好兄弟
Dialogue: 0,0:04:57.37,0:04:58.51,标准-Eng,,0,0,0,,Thank you, my good man
Dialogue: 1,0:05:00.26,0:05:01.32,标准-Chi,,0,0,0,,对不起  派大星
Dialogue: 0,0:05:00.26,0:05:01.32,标准-Eng,,0,0,0,,Sorry, Patrick
Dialogue: 1,0:05:01.32,0:05:04.10,标准-Chi,,0,0,0,,我不可能让你把那块破石头
Dialogue: 0,0:05:01.32,0:05:04.10,标准-Eng,,0,0,0,,but there's no way I'm letting you put your dumb rock
Dialogue: 1,0:05:04.10,0:05:05.07,标准-Chi,,0,0,0,,放进时光胶囊里
Dialogue: 0,0:05:04.10,0:05:05.07,标准-Eng,,0,0,0,,in the time capsule
Dialogue: 1,0:05:05.07,0:05:08.94,标准-Chi,,0,0,0,,我今天都让够多可笑的东西放进去了
Dialogue: 0,0:05:05.07,0:05:08.94,标准-Eng,,0,0,0,,I've allowed some seriously ridiculous items today
Dialogue: 1,0:05:08.94,0:05:11.16,标准-Chi,,0,0,0,,但这玩意已经突破了我底线
Dialogue: 0,0:05:08.94,0:05:11.16,标准-Eng,,0,0,0,,but this is where I draw the line
Dialogue: 1,0:05:11.16,0:05:12.27,标准-Chi,,0,0,0,,明不明
Dialogue: 0,0:05:11.16,0:05:12.27,标准-Eng,,0,0,0,,Do you under--
Dialogue: 1,0:05:12.27,0:05:12.62,标准-Chi,,0,0,0,,什么
Dialogue: 0,0:05:12.27,0:05:12.62,标准-Eng,,0,0,0,,what?
Dialogue: 1,0:05:13.50,0:05:16.20,标准-Chi,,0,0,0,,石头  你要再见拜拜了
Dialogue: 0,0:05:13.50,0:05:16.20,标准-Eng,,0,0,0,,All right, rocky, you're going bye-bye now
Dialogue: 1,0:05:16.20,0:05:17.33,标准-Chi,,0,0,0,,你想得美
Dialogue: 0,0:05:16.20,0:05:17.33,标准-Eng,,0,0,0,,Oh, no, you don't
Dialogue: 1,0:05:26.84,0:05:29.45,标准-Chi,,0,0,0,,没我想象的那么疼啊
Dialogue: 0,0:05:26.84,0:05:29.45,标准-Eng,,0,0,0,,You know, that didn't hurt as bad as I thought it would
Dialogue: 1,0:05:29.45,0:05:30.32,标准-Chi,,0,0,0,,什么东西没啊
Dialogue: 0,0:05:29.45,0:05:30.32,标准-Eng,,0,0,0,,What didn't?
Dialogue: 1,0:05:31.49,0:05:32.52,标准-Chi,,0,0,0,,快看  有个溜溜球
Dialogue: 0,0:05:31.49,0:05:32.52,标准-Eng,,0,0,0,,Look, a yo-yo
Dialogue: 1,0:05:35.38,0:05:37.27,标准-Chi,,0,0,0,,派大星  你太会玩了吧
Dialogue: 0,0:05:35.38,0:05:37.27,标准-Eng,,0,0,0,,Patrick, you're very good at that
Dialogue: 1,0:05:38.37,0:05:41.86,标准-Chi,,0,0,0,,多谢大家慷慨捐赠
Dialogue: 0,0:05:38.37,0:05:41.86,标准-Eng,,0,0,0,,And thanks so much for all your contributions
Dialogue: 1,0:05:42.11,0:05:46.34,标准-Chi,,0,0,0,,准备好把这东西埋到地下了吗
Dialogue: 0,0:05:42.11,0:05:46.34,标准-Eng,,0,0,0,,So are you ready to put this thing in the ground?
Dialogue: 0,0:05:49.41,0:05:50.37,画面内容,,0,0,0,,{\pos(714,644)}海之霸
Dialogue: 1,0:05:50.75,0:05:53.85,标准-Chi,,0,0,0,,该死的老螃蟹  该死的欢呼人群
Dialogue: 0,0:05:50.75,0:05:53.85,标准-Eng,,0,0,0,,Curse that Krabs and his cheering crowds
Dialogue: 1,0:05:53.85,0:05:56.16,标准-Chi,,0,0,0,,一个破烂时光胶囊有什么了不起的
Dialogue: 0,0:05:53.85,0:05:56.16,标准-Eng,,0,0,0,,Big whoop, a stupid time capsule
Dialogue: 1,0:05:56.58,0:05:57.90,标准-Chi,,0,0,0,,不过埋下去之前
Dialogue: 0,0:05:56.58,0:05:57.90,标准-Eng,,0,0,0,,But before we do
Dialogue: 1,0:05:57.90,0:06:00.17,标准-Chi,,0,0,0,,我想自己来捐赠一样东西
Dialogue: 0,0:05:57.90,0:06:00.17,标准-Eng,,0,0,0,,I'd like to make a contribution of me own:
Dialogue: 1,0:06:00.17,0:06:02.96,标准-Chi,,0,0,0,,蟹黄堡秘方的副本
Dialogue: 0,0:06:00.17,0:06:02.96,标准-Eng,,0,0,0,,A copy of the Krabby Patty formula
Dialogue: 1,0:06:04.65,0:06:06.95,标准-Chi,,0,0,0,,就在那里  这个要素
Dialogue: 0,0:06:04.65,0:06:06.95,标准-Eng,,0,0,0,,There it is, the one element
Dialogue: 1,0:06:06.95,0:06:09.14,标准-Chi,,0,0,0,,可以把海之霸这个荒凉的铁桶
Dialogue: 0,0:06:06.95,0:06:09.14,标准-Eng,,0,0,0,,that could turn this lonesome bucket of steel
Dialogue: 1,0:06:09.15,0:06:11.31,标准-Chi,,0,0,0,,变成一家生意繁忙的知名餐厅
Dialogue: 0,0:06:09.15,0:06:11.31,标准-Eng,,0,0,0,,into a bustling world-famous eatery
Dialogue: 1,0:06:17.70,0:06:18.82,标准-Chi,,0,0,0,,埋下去吧
Dialogue: 0,0:06:17.70,0:06:18.82,标准-Eng,,0,0,0,,Send 'er down
Dialogue: 1,0:06:30.12,0:06:30.81,标准-Chi,,0,0,0,,他投篮了
Dialogue: 0,0:06:30.12,0:06:30.81,标准-Eng,,0,0,0,,He shoots
Dialogue: 1,0:06:31.00,0:06:32.26,标准-Chi,,0,0,0,,他进球了
Dialogue: 0,0:06:31.00,0:06:32.26,标准-Eng,,0,0,0,,He scores
Dialogue: 1,0:06:32.26,0:06:34.41,标准-Chi,,0,0,0,,给我起开
Dialogue: 0,0:06:32.26,0:06:34.41,标准-Eng,,0,0,0,,Geeeet off me
Dialogue: 1,0:06:37.63,0:06:39.81,标准-Chi,,0,0,0,,章鱼哥  在干嘛呢
Dialogue: 0,0:06:37.63,0:06:39.81,标准-Eng,,0,0,0,,Hey, Squidward, whatcha doin'?
Dialogue: 1,0:06:39.81,0:06:41.02,标准-Chi,,0,0,0,,看着挺好玩
Dialogue: 0,0:06:39.81,0:06:41.02,标准-Eng,,0,0,0,,Yeah, it looks fun
Dialogue: 1,0:06:41.02,0:06:44.67,标准-Chi,,0,0,0,,我们刚被活埋了  你们两个白痴
Dialogue: 0,0:06:41.02,0:06:44.67,标准-Eng,,0,0,0,,We just got buried alive, you idiots
Dialogue: 1,0:06:45.46,0:06:46.80,标准-Chi,,0,0,0,,没错  不过你在干嘛呢
Dialogue: 0,0:06:45.46,0:06:46.80,标准-Eng,,0,0,0,,I know, but what are you doing?
Dialogue: 1,0:06:51.77,0:06:53.60,标准-Chi,,0,0,0,,谁准备好要来吃蟹黄堡了
Dialogue: 0,0:06:51.77,0:06:53.60,标准-Eng,,0,0,0,,Who's ready to eat some Krabby Patties
Dialogue: 1,0:06:53.60,0:06:56.89,标准-Chi,,0,0,0,,刚刚排队排得一定都饿坏了吧
Dialogue: 0,0:06:53.60,0:06:56.89,标准-Eng,,0,0,0,,'cause all that waiting in line's got ya super hungry?
Dialogue: 1,0:07:12.40,0:07:15.09,标准-Chi,,0,0,0,,接下来五十年应该干什么呢
Dialogue: 0,0:07:12.40,0:07:15.09,标准-Eng,,0,0,0,,What should we do for the next 50 years?
Dialogue: 1,0:07:15.42,0:07:18.07,标准-Chi,,0,0,0,,我要在这里待一阵子
Dialogue: 0,0:07:15.42,0:07:18.07,标准-Eng,,0,0,0,,I'm just gonna hang here for a while
Dialogue: 1,0:07:18.54,0:07:21.04,标准-Chi,,0,0,0,,过后也许要来瓶海草汽水
Dialogue: 0,0:07:18.54,0:07:21.04,标准-Eng,,0,0,0,,maybe get a kelp soda later
Dialogue: 1,0:07:21.04,0:07:22.58,标准-Chi,,0,0,0,,派大星  哪都去不了
Dialogue: 0,0:07:21.04,0:07:22.58,标准-Eng,,0,0,0,,Patrick, you can't go anywhere
Dialogue: 1,0:07:22.58,0:07:23.55,标准-Chi,,0,0,0,,我们被困在这了
Dialogue: 0,0:07:22.58,0:07:23.55,标准-Eng,,0,0,0,,We're trapped down here
Dialogue: 1,0:07:23.55,0:07:25.32,标准-Chi,,0,0,0,,等五十年后有人开胶囊才能出来
Dialogue: 0,0:07:23.55,0:07:25.32,标准-Eng,,0,0,0,,until they open that capsule in 50 years
Dialogue: 1,0:07:25.32,0:07:26.64,标准-Chi,,0,0,0,,五十年
Dialogue: 0,0:07:25.32,0:07:26.64,标准-Eng,,0,0,0,,50 years
Dialogue: 1,0:07:26.64,0:07:27.92,标准-Chi,,0,0,0,,在那之前要怎么办
Dialogue: 0,0:07:26.64,0:07:27.92,标准-Eng,,0,0,0,,What are we gonna do till then?
Dialogue: 1,0:07:28.12,0:07:28.66,标准-Chi,,0,0,0,,不知道
Dialogue: 0,0:07:28.12,0:07:28.66,标准-Eng,,0,0,0,,I don't know
Dialogue: 1,0:07:28.66,0:07:31.02,标准-Chi,,0,0,0,,这里有够玩五十年的东西
Dialogue: 0,0:07:28.66,0:07:31.02,标准-Eng,,0,0,0,,We've got 50 years worth of stuff to play with here
Dialogue: 1,0:07:31.69,0:07:32.84,标准-Chi,,0,0,0,,是我们最爱的游戏
Dialogue: 0,0:07:31.69,0:07:32.84,标准-Eng,,0,0,0,,It's our favorite game
Dialogue: 0,0:07:32.84,0:07:34.51,画面内容,,0,0,0,,{\pos(794,788)}扭扭蝴蝶饼朋友
Dialogue: 1,0:07:32.84,0:07:34.51,标准-Chi,,0,0,0,,扭扭蝴蝶饼朋友
Dialogue: 0,0:07:32.84,0:07:34.51,标准-Eng,,0,0,0,,Pretzel pals
Dialogue: 1,0:07:40.23,0:07:42.69,标准-Chi,,0,0,0,,好好  上次玩到哪里了
Dialogue: 0,0:07:40.23,0:07:42.69,标准-Eng,,0,0,0,,Yes, yes, now, where did we leave off?
Dialogue: 1,0:07:42.69,0:07:45.25,标准-Chi,,0,0,0,,之前我左手应该在红色这边
Dialogue: 0,0:07:42.69,0:07:45.25,标准-Eng,,0,0,0,,I believe my left hand was on red
Dialogue: 1,0:07:45.25,0:07:46.55,标准-Chi,,0,0,0,,我右脚在蓝色那边
Dialogue: 0,0:07:45.25,0:07:46.55,标准-Eng,,0,0,0,,My right foot was on blue
Dialogue: 1,0:07:46.55,0:07:47.73,标准-Chi,,0,0,0,,额头在黄色
Dialogue: 0,0:07:46.55,0:07:47.73,标准-Eng,,0,0,0,,Forehead on yellow
Dialogue: 1,0:07:47.73,0:07:49.01,标准-Chi,,0,0,0,,左脚在绿色
Dialogue: 0,0:07:47.73,0:07:49.01,标准-Eng,,0,0,0,,Left foot on green
Dialogue: 1,0:07:49.37,0:07:50.12,标准-Chi,,0,0,0,,够了
Dialogue: 0,0:07:49.37,0:07:50.12,标准-Eng,,0,0,0,,That's it
Dialogue: 1,0:07:50.12,0:07:51.89,标准-Chi,,0,0,0,,游戏结束
Dialogue: 0,0:07:50.12,0:07:51.89,标准-Eng,,0,0,0,,This game is over
Dialogue: 1,0:07:56.92,0:07:58.01,标准-Chi,,0,0,0,,海绵宝宝
Dialogue: 0,0:07:56.92,0:07:58.01,标准-Eng,,0,0,0,,Hey, SpongeBob
Dialogue: 1,0:07:58.01,0:08:01.25,标准-Chi,,0,0,0,,你觉得未来的裤头村会是什么样的
Dialogue: 0,0:07:58.01,0:07:59.66,标准-Eng,,0,0,0,,what do you think Bikini Bottom
Dialogue: 0,0:07:59.66,0:08:01.25,标准-Eng,,0,0,0,,will be like in the future?
Dialogue: 1,0:08:09.50,0:08:11.67,标准-Chi,,0,0,0,,欢迎来到未来  历史人物
Dialogue: 0,0:08:09.50,0:08:11.67,标准-Eng,,0,0,0,,Welcome to the future, history person
Dialogue: 1,0:08:11.67,0:08:12.90,标准-Chi,,0,0,0,,你不在的这段时间里
Dialogue: 0,0:08:11.67,0:08:12.90,标准-Eng,,0,0,0,,During your absence
Dialogue: 1,0:08:12.90,0:08:15.65,标准-Chi,,0,0,0,,我们的社会取得了诸多进展
Dialogue: 0,0:08:12.90,0:08:15.65,标准-Eng,,0,0,0,,our society has achieved numerous advances
Dialogue: 1,0:08:15.65,0:08:18.35,标准-Chi,,0,0,0,,你看了一定会印象深刻
Dialogue: 0,0:08:15.65,0:08:18.35,标准-Eng,,0,0,0,,we're sure you will find to be quite impressive
Dialogue: 1,0:08:24.82,0:08:25.65,标准-Chi,,0,0,0,,怎么样
Dialogue: 0,0:08:24.82,0:08:25.65,标准-Eng,,0,0,0,,Well?
Dialogue: 1,0:08:29.00,0:08:31.86,标准-Chi,,0,0,0,,给矮子特制的饮水机
Dialogue: 0,0:08:29.00,0:08:31.86,标准-Eng,,0,0,0,,Special drinking fountains for short people
Dialogue: 1,0:08:31.86,0:08:34.12,标准-Chi,,0,0,0,,未来还会发明出什么好东西呢
Dialogue: 0,0:08:31.86,0:08:34.12,标准-Eng,,0,0,0,,What will the future think of next?
Dialogue: 1,0:08:36.30,0:08:38.77,标准-Chi,,0,0,0,,不错嘛  海绵宝宝
Dialogue: 0,0:08:36.30,0:08:38.77,标准-Eng,,0,0,0,,Not bad, SpongeBob, not bad
Dialogue: 1,0:08:39.19,0:08:40.74,标准-Chi,,0,0,0,,我梦想中的裤头村
Dialogue: 0,0:08:39.19,0:08:40.74,标准-Eng,,0,0,0,,I dream of a town
Dialogue: 1,0:08:40.74,0:08:44.75,标准-Chi,,0,0,0,,商务和灌溉完美结合
Dialogue: 0,0:08:40.74,0:08:44.75,标准-Eng,,0,0,0,,with the perfect blend of commerce and irrigation
Dialogue: 1,0:08:45.92,0:08:49.39,标准-Chi,,0,0,0,,更不用说那震撼的美景了
Dialogue: 0,0:08:45.92,0:08:49.39,标准-Eng,,0,0,0,,not to mention the breathtaking views
Dialogue: 1,0:08:52.25,0:08:53.50,标准-Chi,,0,0,0,,如梦似幻啊  派大星
Dialogue: 0,0:08:52.25,0:08:53.50,标准-Eng,,0,0,0,,Sounds dreamy, pat
Dialogue: 1,0:08:53.50,0:08:55.94,标准-Chi,,0,0,0,,你觉得未来会是什么样的  章鱼哥
Dialogue: 0,0:08:53.50,0:08:55.94,标准-Eng,,0,0,0,,What do you think the future will be like, Squidward?
Dialogue: 1,0:08:58.31,0:09:04.02,标准-Chi,,0,0,0,,他的艺术体现我们社会所失去的灵魂
Dialogue: 0,0:08:58.31,0:09:01.52,标准-Eng,,0,0,0,,His artwork embodies the soul
Dialogue: 0,0:09:01.52,0:09:04.02,标准-Eng,,0,0,0,,that our society has lost
Dialogue: 1,0:09:04.02,0:09:05.30,标准-Chi,,0,0,0,,而我们就在这
Dialogue: 0,0:09:04.02,0:09:05.30,标准-Eng,,0,0,0,,and it is here
Dialogue: 1,0:09:05.30,0:09:08.86,标准-Chi,,0,0,0,,启发了那般艺术的受难之地
Dialogue: 0,0:09:05.30,0:09:08.86,标准-Eng,,0,0,0,,the location of the suffering that inspired that art
Dialogue: 1,0:09:09.22,0:09:13.69,标准-Chi,,0,0,0,,开设章鱼哥纪念博物馆
Dialogue: 0,0:09:09.22,0:09:10.65,标准-Eng,,0,0,0,,that we place
Dialogue: 0,0:09:10.65,0:09:13.69,标准-Eng,,0,0,0,,the Squidward Tentacles memorial museum
Dialogue: 1,0:09:23.65,0:09:24.30,标准-Chi,,0,0,0,,章鱼哥
Dialogue: 0,0:09:23.65,0:09:24.30,标准-Eng,,0,0,0,,Squidward?
Dialogue: 1,0:09:25.12,0:09:25.66,标准-Chi,,0,0,0,,章鱼哥
Dialogue: 0,0:09:25.12,0:09:25.66,标准-Eng,,0,0,0,,Squidward?
Dialogue: 1,0:09:26.07,0:09:26.65,标准-Chi,,0,0,0,,章鱼哥
Dialogue: 0,0:09:26.07,0:09:26.65,标准-Eng,,0,0,0,,Squidward?
Dialogue: 1,0:09:27.32,0:09:28.04,标准-Chi,,0,0,0,,章鱼哥
Dialogue: 0,0:09:27.32,0:09:28.04,标准-Eng,,0,0,0,,Squidward?
Dialogue: 1,0:09:33.55,0:09:34.86,标准-Chi,,0,0,0,,中奖了
Dialogue: 0,0:09:33.55,0:09:34.86,标准-Eng,,0,0,0,,Jackpot
Dialogue: 1,0:09:35.30,0:09:39.30,标准-Chi,,0,0,0,,现在来取出秘方
Dialogue: 0,0:09:35.30,0:09:39.30,标准-Eng,,0,0,0,,And now to extract the secret recipe
Dialogue: 1,0:09:40.05,0:09:41.10,标准-Chi,,0,0,0,,小心
Dialogue: 0,0:09:40.05,0:09:41.10,标准-Eng,,0,0,0,,Careful
Dialogue: 1,0:09:41.33,0:09:42.72,标准-Chi,,0,0,0,,小心
Dialogue: 0,0:09:41.33,0:09:42.72,标准-Eng,,0,0,0,,careful
Dialogue: 1,0:09:43.01,0:09:44.67,标准-Chi,,0,900,0,,3个裤头村
Dialogue: 0,0:09:43.01,0:09:44.67,标准-Eng,,0,900,0,,3 Bikini Bottom
Dialogue: 1,0:09:43.01,0:09:44.67,标准-Chi,,0,0,0,,16个裤头村
Dialogue: 0,0:09:43.01,0:09:44.67,标准-Eng,,0,0,0,,16 Bikini Bottom
Dialogue: 1,0:09:46.89,0:09:48.83,标准-Chi,,400,0,0,,19个裤头村
Dialogue: 0,0:09:46.89,0:09:48.83,标准-Eng,,400,0,0,,19 Bikini Bottom
Dialogue: 1,0:09:46.89,0:09:48.83,标准-Chi,,0,600,0,,3个裤头村
Dialogue: 0,0:09:46.89,0:09:48.83,标准-Eng,,0,600,0,,3 Bikini Bottom
Dialogue: 1,0:09:49.25,0:09:50.20,标准-Chi,,0,0,0,,20
Dialogue: 0,0:09:49.25,0:09:50.20,标准-Eng,,0,0,0,,20
Dialogue: 1,0:09:50.54,0:09:52.60,标准-Chi,,0,0,0,,准备好了吗  我们来
Dialogue: 0,0:09:50.54,0:09:52.60,标准-Eng,,0,0,0,,Ready or not, here we
Dialogue: 1,0:09:56.24,0:09:57.67,标准-Chi,,0,0,0,,你想得美  章鱼哥
Dialogue: 0,0:09:56.24,0:09:57.67,标准-Eng,,0,0,0,,Nice try, Squidward
Dialogue: 1,0:09:57.67,0:10:00.92,标准-Chi,,0,0,0,,我们早就想到你那个藏身处了
Dialogue: 0,0:09:57.67,0:10:00.92,标准-Eng,,0,0,0,,but we both already got that hiding spot figured out
Dialogue: 1,0:10:03.43,0:10:04.79,标准-Chi,,0,0,0,,生奶油
Dialogue: 0,0:10:03.43,0:10:04.79,标准-Eng,,0,0,0,,Whipped cream
Dialogue: 1,0:10:09.92,0:10:12.13,标准-Chi,,0,0,0,,这奶油好难吃
Dialogue: 0,0:10:09.92,0:10:12.13,标准-Eng,,0,0,0,,This whipped cream tastes awful
Dialogue: 0,0:10:12.13,0:10:14.30,画面内容,,0,0,0,,{\pos(954,308)}剃须膏
Dialogue: 1,0:10:12.62,0:10:14.31,标准-Chi,,0,0,0,,剃须膏
Dialogue: 0,0:10:12.62,0:10:14.31,标准-Eng,,0,0,0,,Shaving gel
Dialogue: 1,0:10:19.07,0:10:20.95,标准-Chi,,0,0,0,,我一直都想长胡子呢
Dialogue: 0,0:10:19.07,0:10:20.95,标准-Eng,,0,0,0,,I've always wanted a beard
Dialogue: 1,0:10:20.95,0:10:22.60,标准-Chi,,0,0,0,,我也想
Dialogue: 0,0:10:20.95,0:10:22.60,标准-Eng,,0,0,0,,Me too
Dialogue: 1,0:10:25.22,0:10:27.77,标准-Chi,,0,0,0,,你也想长吗  章鱼胡子哥
Dialogue: 0,0:10:25.22,0:10:27.77,标准-Eng,,0,0,0,,Do you want one too, squid-beard?
Dialogue: 1,0:10:31.44,0:10:32.31,标准-Chi,,0,0,0,,什么
Dialogue: 0,0:10:31.44,0:10:32.31,标准-Eng,,0,0,0,,Wha?
Dialogue: 1,0:10:33.43,0:10:34.94,标准-Chi,,0,0,0,,已经五十年了吗
Dialogue: 0,0:10:33.43,0:10:34.94,标准-Eng,,0,0,0,,Has it been 50 years already?
Dialogue: 1,0:10:37.41,0:10:40.62,标准-Chi,,0,0,0,,好啊  我果然还是热辣非凡
Dialogue: 0,0:10:37.41,0:10:40.62,标准-Eng,,0,0,0,,Yes, I knew I'd still be hot
Dialogue: 1,0:10:43.77,0:10:47.65,标准-Chi,,0,0,0,,秘方在哪里
Dialogue: 0,0:10:43.77,0:10:47.65,标准-Eng,,0,0,0,,Secret recipe, where are you?
Dialogue: 1,0:10:54.07,0:10:55.88,标准-Chi,,0,0,0,,你好  未来
Dialogue: 0,0:10:54.07,0:10:55.88,标准-Eng,,0,0,0,,Hello, future
Dialogue: 1,0:11:06.64,0:11:07.55,标准-Chi,,0,0,0,,好
Dialogue: 0,0:11:06.64,0:11:07.55,标准-Eng,,0,0,0,,Yes
Dialogue: 1,0:11:10.87,0:11:11.54,标准-Chi,,0,0,0,,怎么
Dialogue: 0,0:11:10.87,0:11:11.54,标准-Eng,,0,0,0,,What the?
Dialogue: 1,0:11:11.84,0:11:13.35,标准-Chi,,0,0,0,,我的博物馆呢
Dialogue: 0,0:11:11.84,0:11:13.35,标准-Eng,,0,0,0,,Where's my museum?
Dialogue: 1,0:11:13.35,0:11:16.17,标准-Chi,,0,0,0,,未来跟我从前可悲的一生一模一样
Dialogue: 0,0:11:13.35,0:11:16.17,标准-Eng,,0,0,0,,The future is the same as my old pathetic life
Dialogue: 1,0:11:16.17,0:11:17.87,标准-Chi,,0,0,0,,算了吧
Dialogue: 0,0:11:16.17,0:11:17.87,标准-Eng,,0,0,0,,Forget this
Dialogue: 1,0:11:17.87,0:11:19.65,标准-Chi,,0,0,0,,我再等个五十年得了
Dialogue: 0,0:11:17.87,0:11:19.65,标准-Eng,,0,0,0,,I'm waiting another 50 years
Dialogue: 1,0:11:22.52,0:11:25.78,标准-Chi,,0,0,0,,终于拿到蟹黄堡秘方了
Dialogue: 0,0:11:22.52,0:11:25.78,标准-Eng,,0,0,0,,Finally, the Krabby Patty secret recipe
Dialogue: 1,0:11:29.40,0:11:31.95,标准-Chi,,0,0,0,,等我的生活不烂了再把我挖出来
Dialogue: 0,0:11:29.40,0:11:31.95,标准-Eng,,0,0,0,,Dig me out when my life doesn't stink
Dialogue: 1,0:11:38.33,0:11:39.25,标准-Chi,,0,0,0,,不行
Dialogue: 0,0:11:38.33,0:11:39.25,标准-Eng,,0,0,0,,Oh, no
Dialogue: 1,0:11:42.20,0:11:44.05,标准-Chi,,0,0,0,,别伤着自己了  便便宝贝
Dialogue: 0,0:11:42.20,0:11:44.05,标准-Eng,,0,0,0,,Don't hurt yourself, poopsie
Dialogue: 1,0:11:44.37,0:11:45.50,标准-Chi,,0,0,0,,别吵  凯伦
Dialogue: 0,0:11:44.37,0:11:45.50,标准-Eng,,0,0,0,,Quiet, Karen
Dialogue: 1,0:11:45.77,0:11:47.46,标准-Chi,,0,0,0,,再拿点梅干给我润肠通便
Dialogue: 0,0:11:45.77,0:11:47.46,标准-Eng,,0,0,0,,Just bring me more prunes
Dialogue: 0,0:11:49.10,0:11:51.60,起司 特殊标题,,0,0,0,,美梦成真
Dialogue: 0,0:11:51.85,0:11:54.10,画面内容,,0,0,0,,{\frz30\pos(257.33,452)}分镜总监
Dialogue: 0,0:11:51.85,0:11:54.10,画面内容,,0,0,0,,{\frz30\pos(475.661,716)}编剧
Dialogue: 0,0:11:51.85,0:11:56.48,画面内容,,0,0,0,,{\pos(1096,976.667)}翻译{\fnArial}: 1440kHz
Dialogue: 0,0:11:54.23,0:11:56.48,画面内容,,0,0,0,,{\frz30\pos(407.575,446)}创意总监
Dialogue: 0,0:11:54.23,0:11:56.48,画面内容,,0,0,0,,{\frz30\pos(525.742,686)}动画总监
Dialogue: 0,0:11:56.65,0:11:59.07,画面内容,,0,0,0,,{\frz30\pos(431.6,534)}制片指导
Dialogue: 0,0:11:56.65,0:11:59.07,画面内容,,0,0,0,,{\pos(1034.667,976.667)}本字幕仅限学习交流\N严禁用于商业用途
Dialogue: 1,0:12:02.98,0:12:06.41,标准-Chi,,0,0,0,,亲爱的避风港  下班之后见
Dialogue: 0,0:12:02.98,0:12:06.41,标准-Eng,,0,0,0,,Okay, beloved sanctuary, I'll see you after work
Dialogue: 1,0:12:06.60,0:12:09.20,标准-Chi,,0,0,0,,到时来个轻松的夜晚
Dialogue: 0,0:12:06.60,0:12:09.20,标准-Eng,,0,0,0,,and we'll have a nice relaxing evening
Dialogue: 1,0:12:09.20,0:12:11.07,标准-Chi,,0,0,0,,只有你我共处
Dialogue: 0,0:12:09.20,0:12:11.07,标准-Eng,,0,0,0,,Just you and me
Dialogue: 1,0:12:11.87,0:12:15.07,标准-Chi,,0,0,0,,当然前提是今天能撑得过去
Dialogue: 0,0:12:11.87,0:12:15.07,标准-Eng,,0,0,0,,That is, of course, if I can survive another day
Dialogue: 1,0:12:15.07,0:12:18.01,标准-Chi,,0,0,0,,挺过刺耳宝宝的攻势
Dialogue: 0,0:12:15.07,0:12:18.01,标准-Eng,,0,0,0,,with grating Bob shrillpants
Dialogue: 1,0:12:27.98,0:12:31.87,标准-Chi,,0,0,0,,那两个家伙傻得无可救药
Dialogue: 0,0:12:27.98,0:12:31.87,标准-Eng,,0,0,0,,Those two are just so amazingly stupid
Dialogue: 1,0:12:54.19,0:12:55.71,标准-Chi,,0,0,0,,很好玩吧
Dialogue: 0,0:12:54.19,0:12:55.71,标准-Eng,,0,0,0,,Isn't this fun?
Dialogue: 1,0:12:55.71,0:12:58.60,标准-Chi,,0,0,0,,好玩  我爱玩丢伙伴游戏
Dialogue: 0,0:12:55.71,0:12:58.60,标准-Eng,,0,0,0,,Yeah, I love playing "buddy toss"
Dialogue: 1,0:12:58.60,0:12:59.92,标准-Chi,,0,0,0,,早安  章鱼哥
Dialogue: 0,0:12:58.60,0:12:59.92,标准-Eng,,0,0,0,,Good morning, Squidward
Dialogue: 1,0:12:59.92,0:13:00.97,标准-Chi,,0,0,0,,上班见
Dialogue: 0,0:12:59.92,0:13:00.97,标准-Eng,,0,0,0,,See ya at work
Dialogue: 0,0:13:02.42,0:13:04.09,画面内容,,0,0,0,,{\pos(438,436)}蟹堡王
Dialogue: 1,0:13:14.60,0:13:16.42,标准-Chi,,0,0,0,,好  我能行的
Dialogue: 0,0:13:14.60,0:13:16.42,标准-Eng,,0,0,0,,Okay, I can do this
Dialogue: 1,0:13:16.42,0:13:18.48,标准-Chi,,0,0,0,,只要脑袋不去想那几
Dialogue: 0,0:13:16.42,0:13:18.48,标准-Eng,,0,0,0,,Just put them out of my mi--
Dialogue: 0,0:13:21.82,0:13:25.15,标准-Chi,,0,0,75,,上了个极度烦人的班后
Dialogue: 0,0:13:30.74,0:13:31.83,画面内容,,0,0,0,,{\pos(296,570)}锁定
Dialogue: 0,0:13:31.83,0:13:34.83,画面内容,,0,0,0,,{\pos(950,202)}激怒
Dialogue: 0,0:13:31.83,0:13:36.92,画面内容,,0,0,0,,{\pos(348,604)}害虫
Dialogue: 0,0:13:31.83,0:13:36.92,画面内容,,0,0,0,,{\pos(594,616)}烦人
Dialogue: 0,0:13:31.83,0:13:36.92,画面内容,,0,0,0,,{\pos(688,542)}暴怒
Dialogue: 0,0:13:31.83,0:13:36.92,画面内容,,0,0,0,,{\pos(1070,846)}傻子
Dialogue: 0,0:13:31.83,0:13:36.92,画面内容,,0,0,0,,{\pos(814,792)}蠢材
Dialogue: 0,0:13:31.83,0:13:36.92,画面内容,,0,0,0,,{\pos(335.802,846)}白痴
Dialogue: 0,0:13:31.83,0:13:36.92,画面内容,,0,0,0,,{\pos(536,756)}笨蛋
Dialogue: 1,0:13:32.71,0:13:35.92,标准-Chi,,0,0,0,,代表烦人的四字词语  海绵宝宝
Dialogue: 0,0:13:32.71,0:13:35.92,标准-Eng,,0,0,0,,And a nine-letter word for annoying: SpongeBob
Dialogue: 1,0:13:39.45,0:13:42.17,标准-Chi,,0,0,0,,终于能享受宁静了
Dialogue: 0,0:13:39.45,0:13:42.17,标准-Eng,,0,0,0,,Finally some peace and quiet
Dialogue: 1,0:13:42.17,0:13:43.55,标准-Chi,,0,0,0,,不再有海绵宝宝
Dialogue: 0,0:13:42.17,0:13:43.55,标准-Eng,,0,0,0,,No more SpongeBob
Dialogue: 1,0:13:43.75,0:13:45.62,标准-Chi,,0,0,0,,只有我  我自己
Dialogue: 0,0:13:43.75,0:13:45.62,标准-Eng,,0,0,0,,Just me, myself
Dialogue: 1,0:13:45.62,0:13:48.54,标准-Chi,,0,0,0,,还有甜蜜的家
Dialogue: 0,0:13:45.62,0:13:48.54,标准-Eng,,0,0,0,,and home sweet home
Dialogue: 1,0:13:49.85,0:13:52.77,标准-Chi,,0,0,0,,章鱼哥的老藤椅最适合用来
Dialogue: 0,0:13:49.85,0:13:52.77,标准-Eng,,0,0,0,,Nothing like a squid's good old wicker chair
Dialogue: 1,0:13:52.77,0:13:55.03,标准-Chi,,0,0,0,,缓解糟糕的一天带来的痛苦
Dialogue: 0,0:13:52.77,0:13:55.03,标准-Eng,,0,0,0,,to soothe the pains of a rough day
Dialogue: 1,0:13:55.63,0:13:59.62,标准-Chi,,0,0,0,,放松就好  打算一下独处时光怎么过
Dialogue: 0,0:13:55.63,0:13:59.62,标准-Eng,,0,0,0,,Just relax and contemplate some "me time"
Dialogue: 1,0:14:00.32,0:14:04.02,标准-Chi,,0,0,0,,也许我可以放点轻柔爵士来跳舞
Dialogue: 0,0:14:00.32,0:14:04.02,标准-Eng,,0,0,0,,Perhaps I could dance to some smooth-jazz records
Dialogue: 1,0:14:11.89,0:14:14.91,标准-Chi,,0,0,0,,或者随便画上两笔
Dialogue: 0,0:14:11.89,0:14:14.91,标准-Eng,,0,0,0,,Or I could dabble in a little painting
Dialogue: 1,0:14:20.50,0:14:24.05,标准-Chi,,0,0,0,,好啊  我真是太期待了
Dialogue: 0,0:14:20.50,0:14:24.05,标准-Eng,,0,0,0,,Yep, I sure am looking forward to it
Dialogue: 1,0:14:33.64,0:14:35.22,标准-Chi,,0,0,0,,不行不行
Dialogue: 0,0:14:33.64,0:14:35.22,标准-Eng,,0,0,0,,No, no, no
Dialogue: 1,0:14:42.07,0:14:44.32,标准-Chi,,0,0,0,,章鱼哥大驾光临了
Dialogue: 0,0:14:42.07,0:14:44.32,标准-Eng,,0,0,0,,Something Squidward this way comes
Dialogue: 1,0:14:44.32,0:14:46.00,标准-Chi,,0,0,0,,好了  你们两个
Dialogue: 0,0:14:44.32,0:14:46.00,标准-Eng,,0,0,0,,All right, you two
Dialogue: 1,0:14:46.00,0:14:49.41,标准-Chi,,0,0,0,,我今晚还要放松呢
Dialogue: 0,0:14:46.00,0:14:49.41,标准-Eng,,0,0,0,,I am trying to have a relaxing evening
Dialogue: 1,0:14:49.41,0:14:51.87,标准-Chi,,0,0,0,,你们在这外面搞什么鬼
Dialogue: 0,0:14:49.41,0:14:51.87,标准-Eng,,0,0,0,,What in the world are you doing out here?
Dialogue: 1,0:14:52.28,0:14:54.45,标准-Chi,,0,0,0,,想在今晚放松
Dialogue: 0,0:14:52.28,0:14:54.45,标准-Eng,,0,0,0,,Tryin' to have a relaxing evening
Dialogue: 1,0:14:54.45,0:14:56.42,标准-Chi,,0,0,0,,我们在玩手电捉人游戏
Dialogue: 0,0:14:54.45,0:14:56.42,标准-Eng,,0,0,0,,We're playing flashlight tag
Dialogue: 0,0:14:54.45,0:14:56.42,注释,,0,0,0,,[ 手电捉人游戏：用手电筒照到人即视为捉到 ]
Dialogue: 1,0:14:56.70,0:14:59.75,标准-Chi,,0,0,0,,你们在跟电鳗玩手电捉人游戏吗
Dialogue: 0,0:14:56.70,0:14:59.75,标准-Eng,,0,0,0,,You're playing flashlight tag with an electric eel?
Dialogue: 1,0:15:00.01,0:15:01.50,标准-Chi,,0,0,0,,用的是进阶规则呢
Dialogue: 0,0:15:00.01,0:15:01.50,标准-Eng,,0,0,0,,We're using the advanced rules
Dialogue: 1,0:15:01.84,0:15:02.92,标准-Chi,,0,0,0,,进阶规
Dialogue: 0,0:15:01.84,0:15:02.92,标准-Eng,,0,0,0,,Advanced ru--
Dialogue: 1,0:15:03.45,0:15:07.35,标准-Chi,,0,0,0,,那一定是我听过最扯淡的
Dialogue: 0,0:15:03.45,0:15:07.35,标准-Eng,,0,0,0,,That has got to be the most ridiculous thing I have ever--
Dialogue: 1,0:15:08.60,0:15:09.30,标准-Chi,,0,0,0,,你当鬼
Dialogue: 0,0:15:08.60,0:15:09.30,标准-Eng,,0,0,0,,You're it
Dialogue: 1,0:15:13.45,0:15:14.93,标准-Chi,,0,0,0,,好会玩啊  派大星
Dialogue: 0,0:15:13.45,0:15:14.93,标准-Eng,,0,0,0,,Well played, Patrick
Dialogue: 1,0:15:31.86,0:15:33.07,标准-Chi,,0,0,0,,好震撼啊
Dialogue: 0,0:15:31.86,0:15:33.07,标准-Eng,,0,0,0,,Shocking
Dialogue: 0,0:15:31.86,0:15:33.07,画面内容,,0,0,0,,{\fs60\pos(720,920)}电 击
Dialogue: 1,0:15:34.18,0:15:35.74,标准-Chi,,0,0,0,,太有创意了
Dialogue: 0,0:15:34.18,0:15:35.74,标准-Eng,,0,0,0,,How original
Dialogue: 1,0:15:36.65,0:15:40.65,标准-Chi,,0,0,0,,我只是想生活在自己的世界里
Dialogue: 0,0:15:36.65,0:15:40.65,标准-Eng,,0,0,0,,All I really want is to live in a world
Dialogue: 1,0:15:41.20,0:15:46.51,标准-Chi,,0,0,0,,让我能平静地好好放松
Dialogue: 0,0:15:41.20,0:15:46.51,标准-Eng,,0,0,0,,where I can just relax in peace and quiet
Dialogue: 1,0:15:46.51,0:15:48.81,标准-Chi,,0,0,0,,这要求很过分吗
Dialogue: 0,0:15:46.51,0:15:48.81,标准-Eng,,0,0,0,,Is that too much to ask?
Dialogue: 1,0:15:51.47,0:15:53.72,标准-Chi,,0,0,0,,章鱼哥  我们玩的是捉人
Dialogue: 0,0:15:51.47,0:15:53.72,标准-Eng,,0,0,0,,Squidward, we're playing tag
Dialogue: 1,0:15:53.72,0:15:55.55,标准-Chi,,0,0,0,,不是捉迷藏  小笨蛋
Dialogue: 0,0:15:53.72,0:15:55.55,标准-Eng,,0,0,0,,not hide-and-seek, ya silly
Dialogue: 1,0:15:55.55,0:15:59.18,标准-Chi,,0,0,0,,不过你想玩藏迷捉的话  我们也爱玩
Dialogue: 0,0:15:55.55,0:15:59.18,标准-Eng,,0,0,0,,But we like hide-and-go-seek too if you want to play that
Dialogue: 1,0:15:59.42,0:16:02.37,标准-Chi,,0,0,0,,我只是想生活在自己的世界里
Dialogue: 0,0:15:59.42,0:16:02.37,标准-Eng,,0,0,0,,All I really want is to live in a world
Dialogue: 1,0:16:02.73,0:16:04.45,标准-Chi,,0,0,0,,让我能平静地
Dialogue: 0,0:16:02.73,0:16:04.45,标准-Eng,,0,0,0,,where I can just relax
Dialogue: 1,0:16:05.35,0:16:06.62,标准-Chi,,0,0,0,,好好放松
Dialogue: 0,0:16:05.35,0:16:06.62,标准-Eng,,0,0,0,,In peace
Dialogue: 1,0:16:09.40,0:16:12.42,标准-Chi,,0,0,0,,派大星  章鱼哥真的真的很难过
Dialogue: 0,0:16:09.40,0:16:12.42,标准-Eng,,0,0,0,,Patrick, Squidward is really, really sad
Dialogue: 1,0:16:12.42,0:16:13.16,标准-Chi,,0,0,0,,你说得对
Dialogue: 0,0:16:12.42,0:16:13.16,标准-Eng,,0,0,0,,You're right
Dialogue: 1,0:16:13.70,0:16:15.45,标准-Chi,,0,0,0,,去戳别人吧
Dialogue: 0,0:16:13.70,0:16:15.45,标准-Eng,,0,0,0,,Let's go poke someone else
Dialogue: 1,0:16:16.10,0:16:18.49,标准-Chi,,0,0,0,,不然呢
Dialogue: 0,0:16:16.10,0:16:18.49,标准-Eng,,0,0,0,,How about instead
Dialogue: 1,0:16:18.49,0:16:20.72,标准-Chi,,0,0,0,,给他布置一点特别的东西吧
Dialogue: 0,0:16:18.49,0:16:20.72,标准-Eng,,0,0,0,,we do something extra special for him
Dialogue: 1,0:16:20.72,0:16:23.25,标准-Chi,,0,0,0,,那样他就再也不会难过了
Dialogue: 0,0:16:20.72,0:16:23.25,标准-Eng,,0,0,0,,Then he won't be sad anymore
Dialogue: 1,0:16:24.51,0:16:25.66,标准-Chi,,0,0,0,,懂了
Dialogue: 0,0:16:24.51,0:16:25.66,标准-Eng,,0,0,0,,I get it
Dialogue: 1,0:16:25.66,0:16:29.15,标准-Chi,,0,0,0,,就像上次我大受感动的时候
Dialogue: 0,0:16:25.66,0:16:29.15,标准-Eng,,0,0,0,,It'll be like the time I was feeling impressed
Dialogue: 1,0:16:29.15,0:16:31.57,标准-Chi,,0,0,0,,你让我吃掉小蜗的
Dialogue: 0,0:16:29.15,0:16:31.57,标准-Eng,,0,0,0,,and you let me eat all Gary's--
Dialogue: 1,0:16:32.15,0:16:36.01,标准-Chi,,0,0,0,,我是说  喂小蜗一星期
Dialogue: 0,0:16:32.15,0:16:36.01,标准-Eng,,0,0,0,,I mean, feed Gary for a week
Dialogue: 1,0:16:36.01,0:16:38.72,标准-Chi,,0,0,0,,派大星  要加倍特别才行
Dialogue: 0,0:16:36.01,0:16:38.72,标准-Eng,,0,0,0,,Patrick, this has to be extra special
Dialogue: 1,0:16:38.72,0:16:40.47,标准-Chi,,0,0,0,,而且可能应该要特地来宣誓
Dialogue: 0,0:16:38.72,0:16:40.47,标准-Eng,,0,0,0,,and we should probably vow to do it
Dialogue: 1,0:16:40.97,0:16:41.92,标准-Chi,,0,0,0,,宣誓吗
Dialogue: 0,0:16:40.97,0:16:41.92,标准-Eng,,0,0,0,,Vow?
Dialogue: 1,0:16:41.92,0:16:43.30,标准-Chi,,0,0,0,,对  宣誓
Dialogue: 0,0:16:41.92,0:16:43.30,标准-Eng,,0,0,0,,Yeah, vow
Dialogue: 1,0:16:43.82,0:16:46.85,标准-Chi,,0,0,0,,不然就不宣誓了
Dialogue: 0,0:16:43.82,0:16:46.85,标准-Eng,,0,0,0,,Well, how about instead of vowing
Dialogue: 1,0:16:47.15,0:16:48.15,标准-Chi,,0,0,0,,直接开干
Dialogue: 0,0:16:47.15,0:16:48.15,标准-Eng,,0,0,0,,we just do it?
Dialogue: 1,0:16:48.15,0:16:49.05,标准-Chi,,0,0,0,,我喜欢
Dialogue: 0,0:16:48.15,0:16:49.05,标准-Eng,,0,0,0,,I like it
Dialogue: 1,0:16:56.24,0:16:57.40,标准-Chi,,0,0,0,,晚安
Dialogue: 0,0:16:56.24,0:16:57.40,标准-Eng,,0,0,0,,Good night
Dialogue: 1,0:16:58.67,0:16:59.37,标准-Chi,,0,0,0,,台灯
Dialogue: 0,0:16:58.67,0:16:59.37,标准-Eng,,0,0,0,,Lamp
Dialogue: 1,0:17:04.85,0:17:07.80,标准-Chi,,0,0,0,,看来今晚放松
Dialogue: 0,0:17:04.85,0:17:07.80,标准-Eng,,0,0,0,,I guess "having a relaxing evening"
Dialogue: 1,0:17:07.80,0:17:11.42,标准-Chi,,0,0,0,,意思就是通宵玩电力工具
Dialogue: 0,0:17:07.80,0:17:09.42,标准-Eng,,0,0,0,,meant "staying up all night
Dialogue: 0,0:17:09.42,0:17:11.42,标准-Eng,,0,0,0,,and playing with power tools"
Dialogue: 1,0:17:11.81,0:17:13.44,标准-Chi,,0,0,0,,现在还早
Dialogue: 0,0:17:11.81,0:17:13.44,标准-Eng,,0,0,0,,Well, it's not that late
Dialogue: 1,0:17:13.44,0:17:16.05,标准-Chi,,0,0,0,,就连白痴迟早都会睡
Dialogue: 0,0:17:13.44,0:17:16.05,标准-Eng,,0,0,0,,Even morons have to sleep sometime
Dialogue: 1,0:17:21.31,0:17:24.06,标准-Chi,,0,0,0,,再也受不了了
Dialogue: 0,0:17:21.31,0:17:24.06,标准-Eng,,0,0,0,,I can't take it anymore
Dialogue: 1,0:17:24.64,0:17:27.36,标准-Chi,,0,0,0,,等我逮到那两个  我就要
Dialogue: 0,0:17:24.64,0:17:27.36,标准-Eng,,0,0,0,,When I get those two, I am gonna
Dialogue: 1,0:17:27.77,0:17:30.41,标准-Chi,,0,0,0,,你们两个  我
Dialogue: 0,0:17:27.77,0:17:30.41,标准-Eng,,0,0,0,,All right, you two, I
Dialogue: 1,0:17:37.44,0:17:37.83,标准-Chi,,0,0,0,,这
Dialogue: 0,0:17:37.44,0:17:37.83,标准-Eng,,0,0,0,,It--
Dialogue: 1,0:17:38.26,0:17:38.62,标准-Chi,,0,0,0,,这
Dialogue: 0,0:17:38.26,0:17:38.62,标准-Eng,,0,0,0,,it--
Dialogue: 1,0:17:38.89,0:17:40.88,标准-Chi,,0,0,0,,这也太美了
Dialogue: 0,0:17:38.89,0:17:40.88,标准-Eng,,0,0,0,,it's beautiful
Dialogue: 1,0:17:41.90,0:17:44.25,标准-Chi,,0,0,0,,棒得跟假的一样
Dialogue: 0,0:17:41.90,0:17:44.25,标准-Eng,,0,0,0,,It's too good to be true
Dialogue: 1,0:17:46.36,0:17:48.35,标准-Chi,,0,0,0,,这是海市蜃楼
Dialogue: 0,0:17:46.36,0:17:48.35,标准-Eng,,0,0,0,,It's a mirage
Dialogue: 1,0:17:48.35,0:17:49.34,标准-Chi,,0,0,0,,我就知道
Dialogue: 0,0:17:48.35,0:17:49.34,标准-Eng,,0,0,0,,I knew it
Dialogue: 1,0:17:49.60,0:17:52.65,标准-Chi,,0,0,0,,看来就是这样  我疯了
Dialogue: 0,0:17:49.60,0:17:52.65,标准-Eng,,0,0,0,,I guess this is it: Insanity
Dialogue: 1,0:18:03.18,0:18:07.82,标准-Chi,,0,0,0,,下一站  头足类精神病院的软垫病房
Dialogue: 0,0:18:03.18,0:18:07.82,标准-Eng,,0,0,0,,Next stop: A padded room at the cephalopod home
Dialogue: 1,0:18:12.90,0:18:14.28,标准-Chi,,0,0,0,,跟着感觉走  章鱼哥
Dialogue: 0,0:18:12.90,0:18:14.28,标准-Eng,,0,0,0,,Just go with it, squiddy
Dialogue: 0,0:18:26.79,0:18:27.75,画面内容,,0,0,0,,{\pos(984,768)}肥皂
Dialogue: 1,0:18:43.20,0:18:43.75,标准-Chi,,0,0,0,,喝光了
Dialogue: 0,0:18:43.20,0:18:43.75,标准-Eng,,0,0,0,,Empty?
Dialogue: 1,0:18:50.20,0:18:51.97,标准-Chi,,0,0,0,,续杯一下  先生
Dialogue: 0,0:18:50.20,0:18:51.97,标准-Eng,,0,0,0,,A refill, my good man
Dialogue: 1,0:18:52.23,0:18:52.73,标准-Chi,,0,0,0,,怎么
Dialogue: 0,0:18:52.23,0:18:52.73,标准-Eng,,0,0,0,,What the?
Dialogue: 1,0:18:53.63,0:18:55.90,标准-Chi,,0,0,0,,派大星  你在这干嘛
Dialogue: 0,0:18:53.63,0:18:55.90,标准-Eng,,0,0,0,,Patrick, what are you doing here?
Dialogue: 1,0:19:04.09,0:19:05.95,标准-Chi,,0,0,0,,还挺好喝
Dialogue: 0,0:19:04.09,0:19:05.95,标准-Eng,,0,0,0,,It's delicious
Dialogue: 1,0:19:06.17,0:19:06.71,标准-Chi,,0,0,0,,这是什么
Dialogue: 0,0:19:06.17,0:19:06.71,标准-Eng,,0,0,0,,What is it?
Dialogue: 1,0:19:06.96,0:19:08.04,标准-Chi,,0,0,0,,冰沙
Dialogue: 0,0:19:06.96,0:19:08.04,标准-Eng,,0,0,0,,A smoothie
Dialogue: 1,0:19:09.65,0:19:12.59,标准-Chi,,0,0,0,,章鱼哥别忘了  跟着感觉走
Dialogue: 0,0:19:09.65,0:19:12.59,标准-Eng,,0,0,0,,Remember, squiddy, just go with it
Dialogue: 1,0:19:22.17,0:19:24.10,标准-Chi,,0,0,0,,大家看  是章鱼哥
Dialogue: 0,0:19:22.17,0:19:24.10,标准-Eng,,0,0,0,,Hey, fellas, look, it's Squidward
Dialogue: 1,0:19:25.90,0:19:27.55,标准-Chi,,0,0,0,,兄弟  你到哪去了
Dialogue: 0,0:19:25.90,0:19:27.55,标准-Eng,,0,0,0,,Hey, buddy, where you been?
Dialogue: 1,0:19:29.77,0:19:30.89,标准-Chi,,0,0,0,,大家开唱吧
Dialogue: 0,0:19:29.77,0:19:30.89,标准-Eng,,0,0,0,,Hit it, boys
Dialogue: 1,0:19:31.07,0:19:36.18,标准-Chi,,0,0,0,,欢迎光临章鱼哥提基王国
Dialogue: 0,0:19:31.07,0:19:36.18,标准-Eng,,0,0,0,,Welcome to Squidward's tiki land
Dialogue: 1,0:19:38.48,0:19:43.30,标准-Chi,,0,0,0,,欢迎光临章鱼哥提基王国
Dialogue: 0,0:19:38.48,0:19:43.30,标准-Eng,,0,0,0,,Welcome to Squidward's tiki land
Dialogue: 1,0:19:45.53,0:19:50.38,标准-Chi,,0,0,0,,你可以在这里像提基放松
Dialogue: 0,0:19:45.53,0:19:50.38,标准-Eng,,0,0,0,,You can relax all day like a tiki can
Dialogue: 1,0:19:53.47,0:19:58.37,标准-Chi,,0,0,0,,或躺在阳光下晒提基日光浴
Dialogue: 0,0:19:53.47,0:19:58.37,标准-Eng,,0,0,0,,Or lay out in the sun for a tiki tan
Dialogue: 1,0:20:00.75,0:20:06.89,标准-Chi,,0,0,0,,或捧着装满焦糖布丁的椰子畅饮
Dialogue: 0,0:20:00.75,0:20:06.89,标准-Eng,,0,0,0,,Or drink from a coconut that's full of flan
Dialogue: 1,0:20:08.74,0:20:13.72,标准-Chi,,0,0,0,,在章鱼哥提基王国这里
Dialogue: 0,0:20:08.74,0:20:13.72,标准-Eng,,0,0,0,,Here in Squidward's tiki land
Dialogue: 1,0:20:15.62,0:20:20.91,标准-Chi,,0,0,0,,可以参加提基乐团奏乐一整天
Dialogue: 0,0:20:15.62,0:20:20.91,标准-Eng,,0,0,0,,You can play all day in a tiki band
Dialogue: 1,0:20:23.22,0:20:28.38,标准-Chi,,0,0,0,,再到提基河岸舞蹈一整晚
Dialogue: 0,0:20:23.22,0:20:28.38,标准-Eng,,0,0,0,,Then dance all night on the tiki strand
Dialogue: 1,0:20:30.92,0:20:33.50,标准-Chi,,0,0,0,,我无所谓了  因为
Dialogue: 0,0:20:30.92,0:20:33.50,标准-Eng,,0,0,0,,Don't matter to me 'cause
Dialogue: 1,0:20:33.50,0:20:37.13,标准-Chi,,0,0,0,,因为我疯了
Dialogue: 0,0:20:33.50,0:20:37.13,标准-Eng,,0,0,0,,'cause I'm crazy man
Dialogue: 1,0:20:38.65,0:20:43.67,标准-Chi,,0,0,0,,在章鱼哥提基王国这里
Dialogue: 0,0:20:38.65,0:20:43.67,标准-Eng,,0,0,0,,Here in Squidward's tiki land
Dialogue: 1,0:20:48.37,0:20:50.65,标准-Chi,,0,0,0,,这就是生活
Dialogue: 0,0:20:48.37,0:20:50.65,标准-Eng,,0,0,0,,This is the life
Dialogue: 1,0:21:11.55,0:21:16.25,标准-Chi,,0,0,0,,好美啊
Dialogue: 0,0:21:11.55,0:21:16.25,标准-Eng,,0,0,0,,It's beautiful
Dialogue: 1,0:21:24.41,0:21:28.05,标准-Chi,,0,0,0,,我这辈子从来没这么开心过
Dialogue: 0,0:21:24.41,0:21:28.05,标准-Eng,,0,0,0,,I've never been this happy in my life
Dialogue: 1,0:21:49.62,0:21:50.95,标准-Chi,,0,0,0,,我的世界
Dialogue: 0,0:21:49.62,0:21:50.95,标准-Eng,,0,0,0,,My world
Dialogue: 1,0:21:59.52,0:22:01.27,标准-Chi,,0,0,0,,你说得对  海绵宝宝
Dialogue: 0,0:21:59.52,0:22:01.27,标准-Eng,,0,0,0,,You were right, SpongeBob
Dialogue: 1,0:22:01.58,0:22:04.84,标准-Chi,,0,0,0,,早知道就用胶水不用耳屎了
Dialogue: 0,0:22:01.58,0:22:04.84,标准-Eng,,0,0,0,,We should've used glue instead of earwax
Dialogue: 1,0:22:04.84,0:22:07.55,标准-Chi,,0,0,0,,对啊  尤其是考虑到我们都没耳朵
Dialogue: 0,0:22:04.84,0:22:07.55,标准-Eng,,0,0,0,,Yeah, especially considering neither of us have ears
Dialogue: 1,0:22:08.55,0:22:09.07,标准-Chi,,0,0,0,,你们
Dialogue: 0,0:22:08.55,0:22:09.07,标准-Eng,,0,0,0,,You--
Dialogue: 1,0:22:09.57,0:22:13.31,标准-Chi,,0,0,0,,你们毁了我美丽的世界
Dialogue: 0,0:22:09.57,0:22:13.31,标准-Eng,,0,0,0,,you destroyed my beautiful world
Dialogue: 1,0:22:13.61,0:22:16.37,标准-Chi,,0,0,0,,抱歉没法让它永存  章鱼哥
Dialogue: 0,0:22:13.61,0:22:16.37,标准-Eng,,0,0,0,,Sorry we couldn't make it last forever, Squidward
Dialogue: 1,0:22:16.37,0:22:19.69,标准-Chi,,0,0,0,,对啊  我们已经尽力让它保持下去了
Dialogue: 0,0:22:16.37,0:22:19.69,标准-Eng,,0,0,0,,Yeah, we really tried to make it last
Dialogue: 1,0:22:19.85,0:22:20.42,标准-Chi,,0,0,0,,对
Dialogue: 0,0:22:19.85,0:22:20.42,标准-Eng,,0,0,0,,Yeah
Dialogue: 1,0:22:21.34,0:22:22.42,标准-Chi,,0,0,0,,让它保持下去
Dialogue: 0,0:22:21.34,0:22:22.42,标准-Eng,,0,0,0,,make it last
